sequenceDiagram
  User -> App: Start trip recording
  activate App

  App -> PermissionService: Check GPS and sensor permissions
  activate PermissionService
  PermissionService -> App: Permissions granted
  deactivate PermissionService

  App -> GPS: Start location acquisition
  activate GPS
  App -> Sensors: Start sensor acquisition
  activate Sensors

  loop While recording is active
    GPS -> App: Location sample
    Sensors -> App: Sensor sample
  end

  User -> App: Stop trip recording

  App -> GPS: Stop acquisition
  deactivate GPS
  App -> Sensors: Stop acquisition
  deactivate Sensors

  App -> App: Reconstruct path and compute statistics
  App -> Database: Store trip in personal history
  activate Database
  Database -> App: Trip stored
  deactivate Database

  App -> User: Trip saved in history
  deactivate App